{"product_id":"ijoy-capo-squonker-100w-starter-kit","title":"iJOY CAPO Squonker 100W Starter Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe iJoy CAPO Squonker 100W Starter Kit caters to a rebuildable builder's dream, deploying a versatile bottom-feeding COMBO RDA with the 21700\/20700 platform of the CAPO Squonk 100W Box Mod. The CAPO Squonker Box Mod is constructed to fully accommodate the new iJoy 21700 3750 40A Battery (not included), with the option of using 20700 battery (not included) to provide a versatile, long-lasting device with phenomenal performance capability. The battery is top-loaded through a threaded battery cap, with the squonk-ready section located adjacent for ergonomic control while simultaneously catering to building enthusiast. The internal chipset features a maximum output rating of 100W with effective fine-tuning adjustments.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe iJoy COMBO Triangle RDA delivers a user-friendly two-post, dual terminal design with triangular orientation along with bottom airflow and the introduction of a full-ULTEM exterior structure. Measuring 25mm in diameter, the COMBO RDA presents a 3-piece structure with 24K gold-plated base, ULTEM drip tip, and high-quality Stainless Steel or ULTEM wall sleeve. Airflow is cleverly implemented onto the base section with dual etched cutouts where air channels enters the structure and adjusted via knurled top cap. \u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eiJoy CAPO Squonk 100W Box Mod Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSingle 21700 High-Amp Battery - Not Included\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSingle 20700 High-Amp Battery - Not Included\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSingle 18650 High-Amp Battery - Requires Battery Adapter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaximum Wattage Ouput: 100W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMinimum Atomizer Resistance: 0.05ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive OLED Display\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOversized Rectangular Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustment Buttons Below Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop-Loaded Threaded Battery Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSquonk-Ready Bottom-Feeding Section\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvercurrent Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvervoltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvercharge Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicroUSB Port - Firmware Upgrades\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpring-Loaded Stainless Steel 510 Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eiJoy COMBO Triangle RDA Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e25mm Diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e9mm Deep Juice Well\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSuperior Stainless Steel Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGold-Plated Two-Post, Dual Terminal Design - Triangular Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3mm by 3mm Terminal Openings\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePEEK Insulators\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Slotted Side Airflow Control - 10mm by 2.5 per Airslot\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Bottom Vortex Airflow - Angled at 45 Degrees\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e9mm 810 ULTEM Widebore Drip Tip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGold-Plated 510 Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 CAPO Squonker 100W Mod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Combo Triangle RDA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Squonk Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 Prebuilt Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 18650 Battery Adapter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 MicroUSB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpare Parts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInstructional Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease have a great understanding and technical knowledge on how to use this product in order to properly use it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn order to use temperature control feature, it requires use of nickel, titanium, or stainless steel coils.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"iJOY","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41700846403639,"sku":"69d25f831452f","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/ijoy_capo_squonk_100w_starter_kit_silver.jpg?v=1749517583","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/ijoy-capo-squonker-100w-starter-kit","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




